; Generated XY trajectory. Units: mm, mm/s, milliseconds.
; Reserved coordinate system and program must be verified before hardware use.
; I42=0 selects TM timing globally. Isx90=1000 selects seconds for velocity.
CLOSE
&1
#1->100X
#2->100Y
I42=0
I5190=1000
OPEN PROG 20 CLEAR
